# Packages (future)

When `packages/` is scaffolded:

- TypeScript, ESM-first, tree-shakeable exports; generate typings.
- Icon components MUST accept an accessible name path (ARIA / title).
- Use `currentColor`; do not hardcode theme palettes in components.
- Prefer SSR-safe React/Vue/Svelte/web-component builds.
- Do not add a package without matching docs and tests in the same change set when releasing.
